<i>The merchant eyes you warily</i>
I don't know you. I don't trust you. I don't sell to you.
<i>The merchant steps forward, leaning down to whisper in your ear</i>
These people have dedicated themselves to the survival of this town. If you screw with them <i>outsider</i>, I will depleat my gold storage to ensure your demise.
<i>The merchant steps away, turning his back to you. You slink away with  a  fresh chill running down your spine.</i>